{"version":3,"pageFormat":"notebook-900x1200-v1","id":"6ee07a63-691d-44d0-bbe3-56afc6f605a1","title":"webs","created":"2026-10-14T21:30:09.280Z","pages":[{"id":"b9c8e764-0747-4f6b-aeb9-db30dd126cd9","elements":[{"id":"e25fdec9-5c87-4c5a-949c-fd4abf0a0abb","type":"text","x":-8,"y":0,"w":362.6666259765625,"h":253.33338928222656,"rotation":0,"doc":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"grass flickers without worry and i am still in the same desperate corner. pleas getting stuck in the cobwebs as the spiders dance down from the ceiling, pirouetting until it meets my eyes. they seem to have been dancing for so long that i think they have forgotten there was ever music. ","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]}]},"font":"handwriting","fontSize":32,"fixedHeight":true},{"id":"4090b176-e7f5-408d-9397-63bd23ccabad","type":"text","x":377.333251953125,"y":0,"w":445.33349609375,"h":250.6666259765625,"rotation":0,"doc":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"everyone wants something from me, but all they get is a mess. i keep handing them handfuls of tangled string and calling it an answer. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"here— ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"take this. make something out of it. make it into a rope. make it into a ladder. make it into a noose. make it into anything that might finally get me somewhere. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"but the string only knots itself tighter. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"it should’ve reached some sort of climax by now. i should’ve blown up my life. it should’ve taken me with it. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]}]},"font":"handwriting","fontSize":14,"fixedHeight":true},{"id":"ce914361-8e5b-4706-81bc-a8dcce399535","type":"text","x":-9.333251953125,"y":282.50001525878906,"w":823.9998779296875,"h":537.3331909179688,"rotation":0,"doc":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"i should’ve concluded the historic battle by now, but apparently the armies have misplaced their maps. the horses have wandered off. the swords are rusting in the mud and everyone keeps insisting the war is happening. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"i keep waking up in the same fields with the same dirt in my mouth. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"the flags are still waving. the dead keep getting back up. the sun keeps rising over a battlefield that has long forgotten what it was fighting for. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"hardBreak"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"it should’ve stopped repeating itself but it doesn’t. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i keep walking in circles and calling it progress. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i keep changing the scenery and pretending i have escaped. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"look! a different tree! a different cloud! a different crack in the pavement! ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"surely this must be somewhere else. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"surely i must be someone else. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"hardBreak"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"but then i look down— there i am. same shoes. same feet. same stupid shadow following three steps behind me like it knows the joke. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i heed no warnings, ran the stop signs, blabbed my mouth my mouth like a cannon, and shot bombs when there was no threat. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"i have always been good at declaring war on things that were not attacking me. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"a bird lands on the fence and i prepare for a siege.","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"a door creaks and i sharpen my knives. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"someone goes quiet and i build a whole funeral around it. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i have buried entire kingdoms because somebody took too long to answer me. then i stand in the rubble and wonder why everything is so quiet. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph"}]},"font":"handwriting","fontSize":15,"fixedHeight":true}]},{"id":"0bed5876-2009-4d64-9e28-5e7754fa1946","elements":[{"id":"a6742678-241b-48cf-9758-557e2433c334","type":"photo","x":32,"y":40.00006103515648,"w":736.567626953125,"h":884.2265533411488,"rotation":0,"src":"media/3b19be75c80699d3f10c2d4e09d56934e2c439db.png","alt":""},{"id":"f410e869-0e5b-4028-9fc8-315ef6157434","type":"text","x":304.000244140625,"y":869.3333129882812,"w":183.9998779296875,"h":48,"rotation":0,"doc":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"i always feel so scared.","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#FFFFFF"}}]}]}]},"font":"handwriting","fontSize":15,"fixedHeight":true}]},{"id":"1fac2c12-6838-4f1f-ace9-adeda60eec21","elements":[{"id":"bad380cc-9111-4542-a155-92f6543594ab","type":"text","x":2.666748046875,"y":62.50007629394531,"w":798.6669921875,"h":420.000244140625,"rotation":0,"doc":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"there! ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"the little truth. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"the mouse beneath the floorboards. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"the tiny wet thing chewing holes through my chest.","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i carry it everywhere. it rides in my pockets. it sleeps under my tongue. sometimes it climbs into my throat and refuses to come down. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i tell it there is nothing to be afraid of. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"it laughs. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i tell it we are safe. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"it laughs harder. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"i tell it to shut up. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"it starts screaming. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"so i keep running. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"faster. ","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"that is what i do. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"faster. ","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"i move. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"faster. ","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"i run. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"faster. ","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"i stumble. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"faster. ","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"i turn around. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"faster. i don’t stop running. ","marks":[{"type":"italic"},{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"hardBreak"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"lineHeight":1.38,"spaceBefore":0,"spaceAfter":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"somehow the world keeps putting the same corner in front of me. the corner has become very familiar. sometimes i think the corner knows me too. i think it waits for me. ","marks":[{"type":"textStyle","attrs":{"font":"serif","fontSize":14.666666666666666,"color":"#000000"}}]}]}]},"font":"handwriting","fontSize":15,"fixedHeight":true}]}],"status":"draft","publishedAt":null,"updatedAt":"2026-10-18T02:44:38.042Z","updatedBy":342274735}